1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,302
Now contract.

2
00:00:01,302 --> 00:00:06,705
The actin filaments slide in over the myosin, pulling the Z lines together.

3
00:00:06,705 --> 00:00:08,020
Watch the bands.

4
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,622
The I band shrinks.

5
00:00:09,622 --> 00:00:12,317
The H zone shrinks and can vanish.

6
00:00:12,317 --> 00:00:18,450
But the A band does not change at all, because the myosin filaments themselves never shorten.

7
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:19,570
They just slide.

